      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 103 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Everyday)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My weekday is similar to the other students in my class."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "From Monday to Friday, I go to school for about seven hours"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and after school, I go to academies for several more hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even after I come home,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I study for a couple more hours before going to sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes, I feel like I study too much, and it is too hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though it is hard work, I am happy to learn new things"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and spend time with my friends."
    },
